# ======================================================================================================
# Kept on the maintainer's disk but NOT in the public repository (github.com/Agniflux/Likhon).
# The repository is the app: source, installer, Linux, Mac, the build workflow, and the design tokens and artwork the
# builds read. Nothing internal, personal or of unclear licence.
# ======================================================================================================

# Internal: signing tools and key notes, the maintainer's brief
/Signer/
# Every CLAUDE.md, at any depth (and agent instruction files): the maintainer's working briefs stay local
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/

